Package: owntech-installer
Version: 0.1.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash
Maintainer: OwnTech <noreply@owntech-foundation.org>
Homepage: https://github.com/owntech-foundation/Core
Description: OwnTech environment installer
 Sets up the tools needed to build and flash OwnTech Core firmware:
 git, CMake, VS Code (+ PlatformIO/CMake extensions), clones the Core
 repo, and bootstraps/builds it once via PlatformIO. Thin wrapper
 around the same install_owntech.sh script usable standalone from the
 command line -- see /opt/owntech-installer/.
